      "mergeID": "629fecdf245d890bb1a77942",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Quest currently isn't able to have constraints on avatars. I feel this should be something that should be added to quest its not to hard to run and I think it would be a fun tool to add for avatars.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Constraints Quest Compatible",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
