      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Mmmmmm, yeah - got a bunch of avatars I have to either entirely redesign or abandon for Quest due to no constraints.\nSome with grabbable objects which are less optimised (can't re-parent the object bones, have to have duplicates which are shown/hidden), some with multiple limb sets or extra bones (my main avatar has Digitagrade legs) which can't be done at all.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
